					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: UNPACKING TEXTURE CHANNELS\n\nIn this example we are using the Unpack node to get the separate Texture2Dchannel elements from the Texture2Drgba type.\nNext, we construct a Texture2Drgba again using the Texture node, but we're shifting the channels around."
					}
				},
